# Outlet management
# Requires a valid session and an active organization.

### List outlets for the active org
GET {{host}}/api/outlets
Accept: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

### Create an outlet
POST {{host}}/api/outlets
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "name": "Main Dining Hall",
  "code": "MAIN"
}

### Get one outlet profile
GET {{host}}/api/outlets/{{outletId}}
Accept: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

### Update one outlet profile
PUT {{host}}/api/outlets/{{outletId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "name": "Main Dining Hall",
  "alias": "Main",
  "type": "restaurant",
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "city": "Bengaluru",
  "state": "Karnataka",
  "currency": "INR",
  "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata",
  "is_active": true
}
